    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Josca Ferrand, swordmistress of the Illadra Academy, the most celebrated blade in Gradsul.</strong> Forty. CR 4.</p><p>Tall, scarred, amused and very good. She drinks at the Mermaid's because it is the one room in the city where nobody can challenge her, and she is a regular at the bar every night she is not teaching.</p><p><strong>In the brawl:</strong> delighted. She joins in on round two on whichever side looks outnumbered, barehanded, laughing, and she does not lose. If the party fights well without steel she buys them a drink and offers any one of them a lesson at the Academy; if anyone draws, she is the first person in the room to take the blade off them.</p><p><em>Sheet derived from the Merev Sarth stat block (CR 4, 65 hp) \u2014 kit renamed; Merev's courier kit dropped.</em></p>",
