      "img": "icons/skills/movement/feet-winged-sandals-tan.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>When an attacker that you can see hits you with an attack roll, you can take a Reaction to halve the attack\u2019s damage against you (round down).</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-fLqTNntX7T0swRsu\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>With your token selected you can either right click on the damage roll's chat card and select <span class=\"reference\"><em class=\"fas fa-user-shield\">\u00a0</em>Apply Half Damage</span> or click the \"1/2\" button and then the <span class=\"reference\"><em class=\"fa-solid fa-reply-all\">\u00a0</em>Apply</span> button.</p></section>",
